---

Note: this project is an independent reimplementation, written from scratch
with synthetic data, of a predict-then-schedule idea (GRU forecasting driving
an MPC scheduler) explored in the author's research on the water/carbon
footprint of AI workloads. It is not the official code release for any paper
and contains no code, data, or figures from that research codebase.
